meta {
  name: Continue Chat From Share
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/shares/{{shareCode}}/continue
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Authenticated: creates a new conversation owned by the caller, rebuilt from
  the share's SNAPSHOT (not from the original conversation — stays correct for
  future subset shares).

  Response: { "id": "...", "title": "<shared title>" }

  - The new conversation uses the shared title as-is — no "Branched -" prefix
    and no branchOf/branchedFromTurnId lineage, so it never shows a
    "Branched from ..." marker.
  - 401 without a valid token; 404 when the share is gone or expired.
}
